 {"kind": "fits", "text": "my root agent keeps routing billing questions to the tech_support sub-agent instead of billing_agent. the descriptions on both look fine to me?? instruction says 'delegate anything about invoices, refunds or charges to billing_agent'. it just... doesn't. using LlmAgent with sub_agents, gemini-2.5-flash. what am I doing wrong"},
